  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "overview",
      "title": "Overview",
      "type": "text",
      "paragraphs": [
        "A reservation picks the smallest free table that seats the party for RESERVATION_MINUTES. Bills are built from menu items whose tax code (TAX_RATE_STD, TAX_RATE_ALC ...) decides the tax.",
        "Paying by member account posts POS_MEMBER_CHARGE and POS_MEMBER_TAX; AR imports them as one invoice to the member with the tax added. Cash and card post POS_SALE straight to cash on hand.",
        "Event bookings hold places, then confirm them (EVENT_BOOKING); cancelling credits the AR invoice and releases the places."
      ]
    },
